 "The current decision‑status log lives in **`docs/current-mental-model/decisions.md`** – the “Decision Log — BINDING” that records every closed, proposed, and open decision.  \n\nThe single source of truth for the *current* work (the “now / current work” state) lives in **`docs/sessions/next-prompt.md`** – the active work‑handoff file that lists the next steps for the session.  \n\n- Decision status → **docs/current-mental-model/decisions.md** (Decision Log — BINDING)  \n- Current work / next‑step state → **docs/sessions/next-prompt.md** (active work handoff)", :model "nvidia_Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-Q8_0.gguf"}
